WEBVTT

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:01.336
AG: That's when she got
a tip: be less authentic.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.741
LF: Yes, well, that was advice
from my therapist,

00:11:03.765 --> 00:11:07.529
who I started seeing
after I was like, "I'm this way,

00:11:07.553 --> 00:11:11.716
and no one is responding to it
the way I want them to."

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:15.986
And it took a lot of inner strength

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:19.612
to pull away from that
and kind of be like,

00:11:19.636 --> 00:11:23.893
"I have to work on portraying
myself differently."

00:11:23.917 --> 00:11:25.375
It was kind of like,

00:11:25.399 --> 00:11:28.118
"You need to think about
how other people see you,

00:11:28.142 --> 00:11:32.648
and it's not their problem
if they see you a certain way.